<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firms plan to buy U.S. soymeal, soybean.</title>
<headline>Philippine firms plan to buy U.S. soymeal, soybean.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine firms plan to buy 15,000 tonnes of U.S. soymeal and 10,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean, Manila traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have received auction invitations from three companies,&quot; one trader told Reuters.</p>
<p>Traders said both orders were for October shipment.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
